{"id":"U05","title":"Living More with Less","titleZh":"少即是多","paras":[{"id":"U05-P1","sentences":[{"id":"U05-P1-S1","hard":false,"text":"Adults understand what it feels like to be flooded with objects."},{"id":"U05-P1-S2","hard":true,"text":"Why do we often assume that more is more when it comes to kids and their belongings?"},{"id":"U05-P1-S3","hard":false,"text":"The good news is that I can help my own kids learn earlier than I did how to live more with less."}],"zh":"成年人明白被物品淹没是什么感觉。但为什么当涉及到孩子和他们的物品时，我们常常认为越多越好呢？好消息是，我可以帮助自己的孩子比我更早学会如何用更少的东西生活。"},{"id":"U05-P2","sentences":[{"id":"U05-P2-S1","hard":false,"text":"I found the pre-holidays a good time to encourage young children to donate less-used things, and it worked."},{"id":"U05-P2-S2","hard":true,"text":"Because of our efforts, our daughter Georgia did decide to donate a large bag of toys to a little girl whose mother was unable to pay for her holiday due to illness."},{"id":"U05-P2-S3","hard":false,"text":"She chose to sell a few larger objects that were less often used when we promised to put the money into her school fund (our kindergarten daughter is serious about becoming a doctor)."}],"zh":"我发现节假日前是鼓励年幼孩子捐赠不常用物品的好时机，而且这很有效。由于我们的努力，我们的女儿乔治亚确实决定捐赠一大袋玩具给一个小女孩，那个小女孩的母亲因病无法支付她的假期费用。她选择卖掉几件较大的、不太常用的物品，当时我们承诺把钱存入她的学校基金（我们上幼儿园的女儿立志成为一名医生）。"},{"id":"U05-P3","sentences":[{"id":"U05-P3-S1","hard":false,"text":"For weeks, I've been thinking of bigger, deeper questions: How do we make it a habit for them?"},{"id":"U05-P3-S2","hard":false,"text":"And how do we train ourselves to help them live with, need, and use less?"},{"id":"U05-P3-S3","hard":false,"text":"Yesterday, I sat with my son, Shepherd, determined to test my own theory on this."},{"id":"U05-P3-S4","hard":false,"text":"I decided to play with him with only one toy for as long as it would keep his interest."},{"id":"U05-P3-S5","hard":false,"text":"I expected that one toy would keep his attention for about five minutes, ten minutes, max."},{"id":"U05-P3-S6","hard":false,"text":"I chose a red rubber ball--simple, universally available."},{"id":"U05-P3-S7","hard":false,"text":"We passed it, he tried to put it in his mouth, he tried bouncing it, rolling it, sitting on it, throwing it."},{"id":"U05-P3-S8","hard":false,"text":"It was completely, totally enough for him."},{"id":"U05-P3-S9","hard":false,"text":"Before I knew it an hour had passed and it was time to move on to lunch."}],"zh":"几周来，我一直在思考更大、更深层次的问题：我们如何让他们把少用物品变成一种习惯？我们又如何训练自己帮助他们学会用更少的东西生活、需要和使用更少？昨天，我和儿子谢泼德坐在一起，决心用自己的理论来验证这一点。我决定只用一个玩具陪他玩，只要这个玩具能保持他的兴趣。我原以为一个玩具最多能吸引他五到十分钟的注意力。我选了一个红色的橡皮球——简单、随处可得。我们互相传球，他试图把它放进嘴里，试着拍球、滚球、坐在上面、扔球。这对他来说完全足够了。不知不觉一个小时过去了，该去吃午饭了。"},{"id":"U05-P4","sentences":[{"id":"U05-P4-S1","hard":false,"text":"We both became absorbed in the simplicity of playing together."},{"id":"U05-P4-S2","hard":false,"text":"He had my full attention and I had his."},{"id":"U05-P4-S3","hard":false,"text":"My little experiment to find joy in a single object worked for both of us."}],"zh":"我们俩都沉浸在共同玩耍的简单之中。他得到了我的全部注意力，我也得到了他的。我那个在单一物品中寻找快乐的小实验对我们俩都奏效了。"}],"words":[{"id":"U05-W01","lemma":"adult","surface":"Adults","pos":"n.","zh":"成年人","sent":"U05-P1-S1","phrases":[{"en":"young adults","zh":"年轻人"}]},{"id":"U05-W02","lemma":"flood","surface":"flooded","pos":"v.","zh":"淹没; 使充满","sent":"U05-P1-S1","phrases":[{"en":"be flooded with","zh":"被...淹没"}]},{"id":"U05-W03","lemma":"object","surface":"objects","pos":"n.","zh":"物品; 物体; 目标","sent":"U05-P1-S1","phrases":[{"en":"everyday objects","zh":"日常物品"}]},{"id":"U05-W04","lemma":"assume","surface":"assume","pos":"v.","zh":"假设; 认为; 承担","sent":"U05-P1-S2","phrases":[{"en":"assume that","zh":"假设..."},{"en":"assume responsibility","zh":"承担责任"}]},{"id":"U05-W05","lemma":"belonging","surface":"belongings","pos":"n.","zh":"财物; 所有物","sent":"U05-P1-S2","phrases":[{"en":"personal belongings","zh":"个人财物"}]},{"id":"U05-W06","lemma":"encourage","surface":"encourage","pos":"v.","zh":"鼓励; 激励","sent":"U05-P2-S1","phrases":[{"en":"encourage sb. to do sth.","zh":"鼓励某人做某事"}]},{"id":"U05-W07","lemma":"donate","surface":"donate","pos":"v.","zh":"捐赠; 捐献","sent":"U05-P2-S1","phrases":[{"en":"donate to","zh":"捐赠给..."},{"en":"donate money","zh":"捐款"}]},{"id":"U05-W08","lemma":"effort","surface":"efforts","pos":"n.","zh":"努力; 尝试","sent":"U05-P2-S2","phrases":[{"en":"make an effort","zh":"努力"},{"en":"spare no effort","zh":"不遗余力"}]},{"id":"U05-W09","lemma":"toy","surface":"toys","pos":"n.","zh":"玩具","sent":"U05-P2-S2","phrases":[{"en":"play with toys","zh":"玩玩具"}]},{"id":"U05-W10","lemma":"due to","surface":"due to","pos":"phr.","zh":"由于; 因为","sent":"U05-P2-S2","phrases":[{"en":"due to illness","zh":"由于疾病"}]},{"id":"U05-W11","lemma":"promise","surface":"promised","pos":"v.","zh":"承诺; 答应","sent":"U05-P2-S3","phrases":[{"en":"promise to do sth.","zh":"承诺做某事"},{"en":"keep a promise","zh":"信守承诺"}]},{"id":"U05-W12","lemma":"fund","surface":"fund","pos":"n. / v.","zh":"n. 基金; 资金 v. 为...提供资金","sent":"U05-P2-S3","phrases":[{"en":"school fund","zh":"学校基金"},{"en":"raise funds","zh":"筹集资金"}]},{"id":"U05-W13","lemma":"serious","surface":"serious","pos":"adj.","zh":"认真的; 严肃的; 严重的","sent":"U05-P2-S3","phrases":[{"en":"be serious about","zh":"对...认真"},{"en":"serious illness","zh":"重病"}]},{"id":"U05-W14","lemma":"train","surface":"train","pos":"v. / n.","zh":"v. 训练; 培养 n. 火车; 列车","sent":"U05-P3-S2","phrases":[{"en":"train sb. to do sth.","zh":"训练某人做某事"}]},{"id":"U05-W15","lemma":"determined","surface":"determined","pos":"adj.","zh":"决心的; 坚定的","sent":"U05-P3-S3","phrases":[{"en":"be determined to","zh":"决心..."}]},{"id":"U05-W16","lemma":"theory","surface":"theory","pos":"n.","zh":"理论; 学说","sent":"U05-P3-S3","phrases":[{"en":"in theory","zh":"理论上"}]},{"id":"U05-W17","lemma":"expect","surface":"expected","pos":"v.","zh":"预料; 期望","sent":"U05-P3-S5","phrases":[{"en":"expect to do sth.","zh":"期望做某事"},{"en":"as expected","zh":"正如所料"}]},{"id":"U05-W18","lemma":"attention","surface":"attention","pos":"n.","zh":"注意力; 关注","sent":"U05-P3-S5","phrases":[{"en":"pay attention to","zh":"注意..."},{"en":"draw attention","zh":"引起注意"}]},{"id":"U05-W19","lemma":"max","surface":"max","pos":"n. / adv.","zh":"n. 最大值; 最大限度 adv. 最多","sent":"U05-P3-S5","phrases":[{"en":"at max","zh":"最多"}]},{"id":"U05-W20","lemma":"rubber","surface":"rubber","pos":"n. / adj.","zh":"n. 橡胶; 橡皮 adj. 橡胶的","sent":"U05-P3-S6","phrases":[{"en":"rubber ball","zh":"橡皮球"}]},{"id":"U05-W21","lemma":"universally","surface":"universally","pos":"adv.","zh":"普遍地; 到处","sent":"U05-P3-S6","phrases":[{"en":"universally available","zh":"随处可得的"}]},{"id":"U05-W22","lemma":"available","surface":"available","pos":"adj.","zh":"可获得的; 有空的","sent":"U05-P3-S6","phrases":[{"en":"be available to","zh":"对...可用"},{"en":"readily available","zh":"容易获得的"}]},{"id":"U05-W23","lemma":"bounce","surface":"bouncing","pos":"v.","zh":"弹跳; 反弹","sent":"U05-P3-S7","phrases":[{"en":"bounce a ball","zh":"拍球"}]},{"id":"U05-W24","lemma":"roll","surface":"rolling","pos":"v.","zh":"滚动; 卷","sent":"U05-P3-S7","phrases":[{"en":"roll up","zh":"卷起"}]},{"id":"U05-W25","lemma":"completely","surface":"completely","pos":"adv.","zh":"完全地; 彻底地","sent":"U05-P3-S8","phrases":[{"en":"completely different","zh":"完全不同"}]},{"id":"U05-W26","lemma":"totally","surface":"totally","pos":"adv.","zh":"完全地; 彻底地","sent":"U05-P3-S8","phrases":[{"en":"totally agree","zh":"完全同意"}]},{"id":"U05-W27","lemma":"become absorbed in","surface":"became absorbed in","pos":"phr.","zh":"沉浸于; 全神贯注于","sent":"U05-P4-S1","phrases":[{"en":"become absorbed in reading","zh":"沉浸于阅读"}]},{"id":"U05-W28","lemma":"simplicity","surface":"simplicity","pos":"n.","zh":"简单; 简朴","sent":"U05-P4-S1","phrases":[{"en":"the simplicity of","zh":"...的简单"}]},{"id":"U05-W29","lemma":"full","surface":"full","pos":"adj.","zh":"满的; 充分的; 完整的","sent":"U05-P4-S2","phrases":[{"en":"full attention","zh":"全部注意力"},{"en":"at full speed","zh":"全速"}]},{"id":"U05-W30","lemma":"experiment","surface":"experiment","pos":"n. / v.","zh":"n. 实验; 尝试 v. 做实验","sent":"U05-P4-S3","phrases":[{"en":"do an experiment","zh":"做实验"},{"en":"experiment with","zh":"用...做实验"}]},{"id":"U05-W31","lemma":"joy","surface":"joy","pos":"n.","zh":"快乐; 喜悦","sent":"U05-P4-S3","phrases":[{"en":"find joy in","zh":"在...中找到快乐"},{"en":"with joy","zh":"高兴地"}]},{"id":"U05-W32","lemma":"single","surface":"single","pos":"adj.","zh":"单一的; 单个的","sent":"U05-P4-S3","phrases":[{"en":"a single object","zh":"一个单一物品"},{"en":"every single","zh":"每一个"}]}],"_v":1786413566727}